    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jun 11, 2014 at 12:16 PM, Joe Cheng <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">The reference to <a href=\"http://maps.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://maps.google.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Uturk7XbCxpa6XU0s_WhQ\">http://maps.google.com</a> should be changed to either <a href=\"https://maps.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://maps.google.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YNIWCwX9hVA4UV0qFcxlk\">https://maps.google.com</a> or //<a href=\"http://maps.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://maps.google.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Uturk7XbCxpa6XU0s_WhQ\">maps.google.com</a>. You may have to ask the plotGoogleMaps package author to make this change.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jun 11, 2014 at 12:02 PM, Regiane Smo <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aptobri...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"overflow:auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n\r\n        <p>I am trying to embed a <code>plotGoogleMap</code> in a shiny app online. \r\nLocally the app works perfectly, but when uploading via <code>shinyapps</code> to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-LR2dnxA8wfAvCJPwzkzs\">shinyapps.io</a> the .html map does not load.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is how the app looks like with the unloaded .html map:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3I5fsd1bCPja-RF9SFRkku\">https://chamaoskurumi.<u></u>shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font><em>Any ideas how to solve this issue?</em></font></p>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<p>See my code below.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>ui.R</strong></p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">\r\n\r\n</span><pre><code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><span>library</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;markdown&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\nlibrary</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;shiny&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n\r\nshinyUI</span><span>(</span><span>navbarPage</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;<u></u>plotGooleMaps in shinyapps&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\r\n                   mainPanel</span><span>(</span><span>uiOutput</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;mymap&#39;</span><span>))</span><span>\r\n                  </span><span>)</span><span>\r\n       </span></span><span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">)</span><br><br><br></span></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>server.R</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><span>library</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;shiny&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\nlibrary</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;plotGoogleMaps&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n\r\nshinyServer</span><span>(</span><span>function</span><span>(</span><span>input</span><span>,</span><span> output</span><span>){</span><span>\r\n  output$mymap </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> renderUI</span><span>({</span><span>\r\n    data</span><span>(</span><span>meuse</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n    coordinates</span><span>(</span><span>meuse</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>~</span><span>x</span><span>+</span><span>y\r\n    proj4string</span><span>(</span><span>meuse</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> CRS</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;+init=epsg:28992&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n    m </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> plotGoogleMaps</span><span>(</span><span>meuse</span><span>,</span><span> filename </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&#39;myMap1.html&#39;</span><span>,</span><span> openMap </span><span>=</span><span> F</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n    tags$iframe</span><span>(</span><span>\r\n      srcdoc </span><span>=</span><span> paste</span><span>(</span><span>readLines</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;myMap1.html&#39;</span><span>)<u></u>,</span><span> collapse </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&#39;\\n&#39;</span><span>),</span><span>\r\n      width </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;900Px&quot;</span><span>,</span><span>\r\n      height </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;500Px&quot;</span><span>\r\n      </span><span>)</span><span>\r\n  </span><span>})</span><span>\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">})</span><br><br><br></span></code></pre>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>deploy app with</strong> <code>shinyapps</code></p>\r\n\r\n<pre><code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><span>library</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;shinyapps&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\nsetwd</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;~/working directory where ui.R and server.R are located locally&quot;</span><span>)</span><span>\r\ndeployApp</span></span><span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">()</span><br><br>----------------------------------------<br>This is the error log that I can&#39;t decipher:<br></span></code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,153,0)\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></pre><div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,153,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span><span>[blocked] The page at &#39;about:srcdoc&#39; was loaded over HTTPS, but ran insecure content from &#39;<a href=\"http://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?sensor=false\" title=\"http://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?sensor=false\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?sensor%3Dfalse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aw-qHINWRY3WwyDtzwBc4\">http://maps.google.com/maps/api/js?sensor=false</a>&#39;: this content should also be loaded over HTTPS.\r\n</span> <a title=\"about:srcdoc\" rel=\"nofollow\">about:srcdoc:1</a></span></span></span></b></div><div>\r\n\r\n<ol><li title=\"\"><b><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,153,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span><span>Uncaught ReferenceError: google is not defined</span> <a title=\"about:srcdoc:21\" rel=\"nofollow\">about:srcdoc:21</a></span></span></span></b></li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ol></div><div><b><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,153,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span><span>GET <a title=\"https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/_w_cf38cbc66a336eaf0ab8b4e184402cba949ec9bc0b5cc5c0/Legendf4d2427a4.png\" href=\"https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/_w_cf38cbc66a336eaf0ab8b4e184402cba949ec9bc0b5cc5c0/Legendf4d2427a4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/_w_cf38cbc66a336eaf0ab8b4e184402cba949ec9bc0b5cc5c0/Legendf4d2427a4.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792365351270000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1X_lXnft6fsBpzjOOeZH72\">https://chamaoskurumi.shinyapps.io/TESTmapSHINY/_w_cf38cbc66a336eaf0ab8b4e184402cba949ec9bc0b5cc5c0/Legendf4d24